it's currently 8, and the OP requires that there be no white shirts (and
I would assume black is also out), the maths is no longer easy.  Wishing
for DS(M) already results in any one of the nine types, so it shouldn't
be too difficult to extend that mechanism in the case of wishing for a
Hawaiian shirt.  But I'm not sure how one would go about getting the
character initialization code to pick one at random for Tourists.

